title: $:/plugins/nikorion/font-manager/language/en-GB/history
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* ''0.5.0'' -- 2026.10.12 -- New ''Fonts'' tab in the plugin info panel: the installed fonts as a sortable table (Dynamic Table, when installed) with a draggable name, a live preview, the font type and the rank (stars), or a plain list otherwise. Star ratings now live in a `rank` field. The readme tells that imported fonts are `text/css` tiddlers.
* ''0.4.0'' -- 2026.10.11 -- `.ttf` and `.otf` files are converted to WOFF2 while importing (bundled WebAssembly encoder, loaded on first use; can be turned off in the settings). Imported fonts that fail to convert are kept as they are, with a note. The readme explains how to keep fonts in their own folder in a Node.js wiki folder.
* ''0.3.0'' -- 2026.10.10 -- The plugin no longer ships any font: it becomes a font manager. Dropping a `.woff2`/`.woff`/`.ttf`/`.otf` file onto the wiki now creates a ready-to-use `$:/fonts/<Name>` stylesheet tiddler (`th-importing-file` hook). The former bundled collection moved to the development wiki and the online demo; installing 0.3.0 over 0.2.0 removes those fonts.
* ''0.2.0'' -- 2026.08.17 -- Localised the licence and version history: `licence.tid` and `history.tid` are now language selectors that block-transclude `language/<lang>/licence` and `language/<lang>/history`, falling back to en-GB — same montage as `readme.tid`. The licence body itself stays in English in every language: only the original text of a licence is legally binding, so only its framing is translated (introduction, headings, //Third-Party Components// prose).
* ''0.1.0'' -- 2026.07.16 -- Hello !
